        ":question/problem": "$\\int 7sec⁡\\theta tan⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int sec⁡\\theta tan⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =sec⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 7sec⁡\\theta tan⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =7\\int sec⁡\\theta tan⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =7sec⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
